body:
Coordinator, merge note for head c38de52a4e87a266c847457d433c3dc277d8d771. Class: no refresh (the head is the reviewed head).

This merge relies on:
- the review marker on this head (21:41Z, "Clean. Ready to merge.");
- my read of the diff: one test file, `crates/app/tests/first_traverse_posed.rs`; it adds three tests and two rig cases, makes one helper return the refusal, and removes an unused helper; no product code;
- a trial merge here, on `main` bd2b774a8 (the merge is clean and changes only that file): the quick plan is one step, `app suites: first_traverse_posed`: 8 passed, 0 failed, with the new tests `one_of_two_work_turning_rotaries_off_the_wcs_origin_refuses_by_name`, `a_zero_pivot_on_two_work_turning_rotaries_reads_the_sphere_as_before` and `a_vertical_work_turning_rotary_with_a_stated_pivot_is_not_refused`. Clippy on that test target is clean.

A test-only PR needs no example catalog run and no heavy step (#3556).

@FlamingFireCoding thank you for the pins.
